@startuml phase5-ivi-ecu-callflow
title Phase 5 — IVI R4 ingest → observer → HMI (R4 consumer, R16, R17)\nADA or mock-sender → UDP JSON → parse → SharedFlow → ViewModels → Compose

actor "ADA ECU\n(nlohmann/json)\nor mock-sender\n(Python)" as Producer
participant "R6 Ethernet Bridge" as Bridge
box "IVI Skycraft AAOS (Kotlin)" #F8F8F8
  participant "R4ListenerService\n(UDP adapter,\nDispatchers.IO)" as Svc
  participant "R4Deserializer\n(kotlinx.serialization)" as Deser
  participant "R4Repository\n(observer)" as Repo
  participant "WarningViewModel\n/ MainViewModel\n(UI logic)" as VM
  participant "MainScreen +\nIviWarningViewSeam\n→ CanvasWarningView\n(R16/R17 UI)" as UI
end box

== Boot ==
Svc -> Svc : bind DatagramSocket\n(BuildConfig.R4_UDP_PORT:\n5004 mock / 47300 production)
Svc -> Repo : attachToService(r4EventFlow)
VM -> Repo : collect warningEvents /\ncurrentState / errors

== Warning path (type=warning) ==
Producer -> Bridge : UDP datagram\n(raw UTF-8 JSON bytes;\nno M1 app Ethernet header)
Bridge -> Svc : datagram to IVI pin IP:port
Svc -> Svc : ByteArray[0..length)\n→ UTF-8 string (IO thread)
Svc -> Deser : deserialize(json)
alt known warningType (e.g. nlos_obstruction)
  Deser --> Svc : R4WarningEvent\n(object + geometry + riskState)
  Svc -> Repo : emit on SharedFlow
  Repo -> VM : warningEvents
  VM -> VM : map to WarningUiState;\nwake Warning View (R16)
  VM -> UI : StateFlow update
  UI -> UI : Render via IviWarningViewSeam\nego / B / ghost C (R17);\nguard if object.source != v2x_relayed
else unknown warningType (additive-version)
  Deser --> Svc : R4WarningEvent\n(degraded / unknown type;\nno throw)
  Svc -> Repo : emit
  Repo -> VM : warningEvents
  VM -> UI : generic banner;\nprocess stays alive
end

== State path (type=state, optional R15) ==
Producer -> Bridge : UDP JSON type=state
Bridge -> Svc : datagram
Svc -> Deser : deserialize
Deser --> Svc : R4StateMessage (seq)
Svc -> Repo : emit
Repo -> Repo : last-value-wins\non currentState by seq
Repo -> VM : currentState
VM -> UI : scene refresh if Idle /\nDisplay Area allows

== Malformed / empty payload ==
Producer -> Svc : bad bytes / empty
Svc -> Deser : deserialize
Deser --> Svc : failure (no crash)
Svc -> Repo : R4ServiceError (optional)
Repo -> VM : error path / logcat
VM -> UI : no forced wake;\nprior mode retained

== Auto-clear ==
VM -> VM : WARNING_TIMEOUT_MS\n(BuildConfig) elapses
VM -> UI : restore prior DisplayMode\nunless user overrode
@enduml
